<article  data-history-node-id="406" class="node node--type-page node--view-mode-full">
  <div  class="node__content">
              <div class="page__body" id="page__body">
        
      <div class="field field--name-field-body-paras field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="gen-list paragraph">

    
              <h2 class="gen-list__header">
          Meet the Coach
        </h2>
      
      
              <div class="gen-list__items">
          
      <div class="field field--name-field-gen-list-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="gen-list__item clearfix paragraph" data-aos="fade-up">

    
              <div class="gen-list__img">
                      
<div class="wysiwyg--media-image media media--type-image media--view-mode-generic-content-image-list">
  
      
  <div class="field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden">
              <div class="field__item">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/default/files/styles/generic_content_image_list/public/uploads/images/2023-11/baseball_corey-coleman.jpg?h=8a7fc05e&amp;itok=cEkMXi9v" width="572" height="485" alt="Corey Coleman" class="image-style-generic-content-image-list" />


</div>
          </div>

  </div>

                  </div>
      
              <h3 class="gen-list__title">
                      Corey Coleman
                  </h3>
      
      
              <div class="gen-list__body">
          <p>The QCC Athletic Program would like to welcome Corey Coleman as the Head Baseball Coach. Coach Coleman graduated from David Prouty High School in 2003 and went onto the college of Charleston in SC. He then came home to QCC, where he played one season and then served as an assistant coach for 2007 through 2009 season. Coach Coleman has been at the helm of the Energy/Wolfpack 15u Elite team since 2019. Coach Coleman has a son Landen who is a freshman at St. John’s high school who plays football and baseball.</p><p><strong>Assistant Coaches:</strong> Kyle Paganelli, Rene Van Beekom, Kyle Sebastyanski</p>
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
          </div>
  
        </div>
      
    
  </div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item">


  <div class="links-block paragraph">
        
          <div class="links-block__items">
        
      <div class="field field--name-field-links-block-items field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">

  <div class="links-block__item paragraph">
                  <h3 class="links-block__section-heading">
          Livestream Games
        </h3>
      
              <div class="links-block__intro">
          <p>Can’t make it to one of our home games? Great news: you can livestream our home games from the comfort of your living room.</p>
        </div>
      
              <div class="links-block__links">
          
        </div>
            
              <div class="links-block__cta">
          
            <div class="field field--name-field-r-section-cta field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item"><a href="https://fan.hudl.com/qccwyverns" target="_blank" rel="noopener">View Livestream</a></div>
      
        </div>
            </div>
</div>
          </div>
  
      </div>
          </div>
</div>
              <div class="field__item">



  <div class="wysiwyg paragraph">
    
              <div class="wysiwyg__body">
          <style>
.content-narrow {
    max-width: 100% !important;
}
</style><h2>Requirements</h2><p>ANY student interested in Baseball will be required to have a Doctors physical being cleared for competitive sports and be enrolled in at least 12 credits to try out for the team.</p><p><img style="width:100%;" src="/sites/default/files/uploads/images/2026-02/2026%20Baseball%20Team%20Picture.jpg" alt="2026 Baseball Team"></p><h2>Schedule</h2><p>Come cheers us on! Home games are free for everyone who would like to attend. Support your community by watching one of our home games!</p><p>If you are interested in playing Baseball, please contact Coach Coleman.<strong>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></p><div class="table table--wysiwyg table"><div class="table__inner"><table class="table" role="table"><thead><tr><th>Date</th><th>Time</th><th>Vs.</th><th>Location</th><th>Depart</th><th>Arrive</th><th>Type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3/14</td><td>9:00 a.m.</td><td>Penn State Schuylkill</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/14</td><td>12:00 p.m.</td><td>Salem CC</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/15</td><td>9 a.m. &amp;&nbsp;<br>12 p.m.&nbsp;<br>DBHD</td><td>MN Itasca</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/16</td><td>12:00 p.m.</td><td>Garrett College</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/16</td><td>3:00 p.m.</td><td>Great Bay CC</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/17</td><td>1:00 p.m.</td><td>Ursinus CC</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/17</td><td>6:30 p.m.</td><td>NHTI</td><td>Myrtle Beach, SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/18</td><td>12:00 p.m.</td><td>Great Bay CC</td><td>Myrtle Beach,SC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/26</td><td>6:00 p.m.</td><td>Mount Saint Charles prep</td><td>Woonsocket, RI</td><td>4:00 p.m.</td><td>9:00 p.m.</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>3/29</td><td>12:00 p.m.&nbsp;<br>DBHD</td><td>Great Bay CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/3</td><td>3:30 p.m.</td><td>Bunker Hill CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/4</td><td>12:00 p.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>Bunker Hill CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/9</td><td>3:30 p.m.</td><td>Massasoit CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/11</td><td>12:00 p.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>Massasoit CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/12</td><td>11:00 a.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>University Maine Fort Kent</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/16</td><td>3:30 p.m.</td><td>CCRI</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/18</td><td>12:00 p.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>CCRI</td><td>Warwick,RI</td><td>9:30 a.m.</td><td>6:30 p.m.</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>4/23</td><td>4:00 p.m.</td><td>Northern Essex CC</td><td>Haverhill,MA</td><td>1:45 p.m.</td><td>6:30 p.m.</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>4/25</td><td>12:00 p.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>Northern Essex CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>4/29</td><td>3:30 p.m.</td><td>Holyoke CC</td><td>QCC</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>HOME</td></tr><tr><td>5/2</td><td>12:00 p.m.<br>DBHD</td><td>Holyoke CC</td><td>Holyoke, MA</td><td>9:30 a.m.</td><td>6:30 p.m.</td><td>AWAY</td></tr><tr><td>5/7</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Region 21 Tournament</td><td>Higher Seed</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>5/9</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Region 21 Tournament</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>TBD</td></tr><tr><td>5/10</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>Region 21 Championship</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>&nbsp;</td><td>TBD</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><h2>Roster</h2><div c